{"name": "MEANWHILE IN SECTOR 80", "description": "<div class=\"game_area_description\" id=\"game_area_description\">\n<h2>About This Game</h2>\n<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Welcome to SECTOR 80 \u2014 a failed region of space where things went SUPER wrong. By the way, you\u2019re stuck here, and trapped in a malfunctioning robot body. How about that!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">But don\u2019t worry, you\u2019ve got me, your best bud, Frank!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img alt=\"An arrow points to a glowing purple orb-y face. The text says &amp;quot;THAT'S ME!&amp;quot;\" class=\"bb_img\" data-big-src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2660180/extras_big/b443fd8cfe2c66d48aa0cfb8c9a7622d.webp?t=1791553702\" height=\"600\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2660180/extras/b443fd8cfe2c66d48aa0cfb8c9a7622d.avif?t=1791553702\" width=\"1560\"/></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Oh, what\u2019s this? I\u2019ve just been handed an instructional pamphlet to read to you good people at home. I'm gonna put my own spin on it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img alt=\"ENGINEER FREELY\" class=\"bb_img\" data-big-src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2660180/extras_big/1c6fb8c002c5ddefae8493183ee44573.webp?t=1791553702\" height=\"250\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2660180/extras/1c6fb8c002c5ddefae8493183ee44573.avif?t=1791553702\" width=\"1560\"/></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"450\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2660180/extras/f7ec32589d5512b206a0872e0a097b34.poster.avif?t=1791553702\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2660180/extras/f7ec32589d5512b206a0872e0a097b34.webm?t=1791553702\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2660180/extras/f7ec32589d5512b206a0872e0a097b34.mp4?t=1791553702\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In MS80, you\u2019re made of things and enemies are made of things. Shoot enemies, take their things, and put their things on your things!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">There are so many things \u2014 firearms, batteries, gimbals, soda cans, armor, tasers, energy shields, my goodness! You\u2019ll never stay the same shape for too long!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img alt=\"BE PHYSICS\" class=\"bb_img\" data-big-src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2660180/extras_big/9407b5913d65fa824fb127ed12c722d4.webp?t=1791553702\" height=\"250\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2660180/extras/9407b5913d65fa824fb127ed12c722d4.avif?t=1791553702\" width=\"1560\"/></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"450\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2660180/extras/34272a18fe8b2ed39c9dc4957002cdaa.poster.avif?t=1791553702\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2660180/extras/34272a18fe8b2ed39c9dc4957002cdaa.webm?t=1791553702\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2660180/extras/34272a18fe8b2ed39c9dc4957002cdaa.mp4?t=1791553702\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> And all those things? They\u2019re <i>physical. </i>That means heat, and mass, and electricity \u2014 fully simulated!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You\u2019re a real live wire \u2014 a running, jumping electrical circuit that eats energy and spits lasers. Good thing SECTOR 80 has more than enough of those to go around.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img alt=\"GET BLASTING\" class=\"bb_img\" data-big-src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2660180/extras_big/1bd328bc197c76e5a8b144c21e2d0aa1.webp?t=1791553702\" height=\"250\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2660180/extras/1bd328bc197c76e5a8b144c21e2d0aa1.avif?t=1791553702\" width=\"1560\"/></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"450\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2660180/extras/d418a60264a5b54d886cea117bd66a62.poster.avif?t=1791553702\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2660180/extras/d418a60264a5b54d886cea117bd66a62.webm?t=1791553702\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2660180/extras/d418a60264a5b54d886cea117bd66a62.mp4?t=1791553702\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Our marketing manager says this is the part where you need to see violence or you'll lose interest!<br/>What, you didn\u2019t expect those pesky evil robots to just hand over their parts nicely, did you?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img alt=\"A glowing purple orb-y face is on a lava planet in front of a giant gun in the distance. The text says &amp;quot;WISHLIST NOW OR THEY'LL DELETE ME&amp;quot;\" class=\"bb_img\" data-big-src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2660180/extras_big/c30bedf1a5b54af6c5c350495e4b4a3f.webp?t=1791553702\" height=\"750\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2660180/extras/c30bedf1a5b54af6c5c350495e4b4a3f.avif?t=1791553702\" width=\"1560\"/></span></p> </div>", "short_desc": "MS80 is an action-engineering adventure in an abandoned star system. Trapped in a robot body, scavenge your way through the aftermath of a robot rebellion. Your body is a weapon \u2014 upgrade it with modular components you take off your enemies, and build yourself a new you!", "header_image": "https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2660180/9675a5dd98a50c3ba6ab76694bd7445130d79ee4/header.jpg?t=1791553702", "screenshots": [], "tags": ["Early Access", "Action-Adventure", "Exploration", "Third-Person Shooter", "Sandbox", "Building"], "developers": "Second Half Games", "publishers": "Second Half Games", "release_date": "Coming soon", "price": "Coming Soon", "appid": "2660180", "review_type": "Informational", "curator_desc": "9 October 2026 - Demo", "yt_link": "https://youtu.be/Ub5YtkPoSrs", "first_seen": 1791496800.0, "review_rank": 3}